        Parameters:
            hist (:class:`.histogram`): The histogram.
            make_value (function): The function to set the value of the graph's point.
            get_coordinate (str): The coordinate of the graph point. Can be "left", "right", and "middle".
            field_names (tuple): The field names of the graph.
            scale (bool or :class:`.scale`): The graph's scale.

        Returns:
